text tologin "login"
text tomsg1 "The form was refused. Give the Radicle id of your project (rad:z...), tick the permission box, and keep the note under 200 bytes."
text tomsgq "The intake queue is full. Nothing was saved. Try again later."
text toh1 "<div class=\"sl\"><h1>Open builds</h1><p>Bring the project that is not finished, or not right yet. It stays open here so other builders and their agents can pick it up over Radicle. Nothing on this shelf is verified until a revision carries a receipt.</p>"
text toh2 "<article class=\"sl-card\"><h2>Bring a project</h2><p>Publish it to Radicle first (<code>rad init</code>, then <code>rad sync --announce</code>), then give its id. This node fetches it and keeps a copy available. Limits: 50 MiB a project, 8 open projects a key. Any signed-in Radicle key can bring a project while the operator keeps intake open; if it is limited to a list of keys, a key that is not on the list sees the refusal here. The operator can remove a listing. You can withdraw yours at any time.</p>"
text toh3 "<p><a href=\""
text toh4 "\">Sign in with your Radicle key</a> to bring a project.</p></article>"
text tof1 "<form method=\"post\" action=\""
text tof2 "\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf\" value=\""
text tof3 "\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"bring\"><p><label>Radicle id <input name=\"rid\" maxlength=\"48\" required placeholder=\"rad:z...\"></label></p><p><label>What is unfinished, in one line <input name=\"note\" maxlength=\"200\"></label></p><p><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" value=\"yes\" required> I have the right to share this project and it carries an open license.</label></p><p><button type=\"submit\">Bring it</button></p></form></article>"
text tol1 "<h2>On the shelf</h2>"
text tol0 "<p>The shelf is waiting for its first project. Unfinished is welcome.</p>"
text toc1 "<article class=\"sl-card\"><h3>"
text toc2 "</h3><p>"
text toc3 "</p><p><strong>Unfinished:</strong> "
text toc4 "</p><pre>rad clone rad:"
text toc5 "</pre><p>Not verified. Brought by "
text toc6 " on "
text toc7 ", "
text toc8 " KiB.</p>"
text toc9 "</article>"
text tow1 "\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"withdraw\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"rid\" value=\""
text tow2 "\"><button type=\"submit\">Withdraw</button></form>"
text tor1 "<article class=\"sl-card\"><h3>rad:"
text tor2 "</h3><p>Only you see this. Intake result: "
text tor3 "</p></article>"
text toend "</div>"
